WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:14.770
"These are very fancy!"

2
00:00:15.011 --> 00:00:15.791
said Mayor Bloom.

3
00:00:17.293 --> 00:00:19.274
Mayor Bloom was at the Metro City Car Show.

4
00:00:20.976 --> 00:00:22.817
The convention center was filled with cars.

5
00:00:24.198 --> 00:00:26.380
A man in a lab coat stepped onto a stage.

6
00:00:28.422 --> 00:00:30.644
Nearby a car was covered by a white sheet.

7
00:00:31.828 --> 00:00:34.891
"You're about to see my latest invention," said the man.

8
00:00:34.911 --> 00:00:37.973
"It's the most amazing car ever!"

9
00:00:39.335 --> 00:00:40.435
He walked toward the car.

10
00:00:41.656 --> 00:00:43.138
Everyone leaned closer to see.

11
00:00:44.459 --> 00:00:45.620
The man grabbed the sheet.

12
00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:48.963
"Behold The man yanked off the sheet.

13
00:00:50.384 --> 00:00:51.725
"The Ultra Car!"

14
00:00:54.427 --> 00:00:55.408
Everybody gasped.

15
00:00:56.489 --> 00:00:59.732
The car had wings, rockets, and lots of fancy gadgets.

16
00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:03.141
Suddenly the car's engine roared.

17
00:01:04.102 --> 00:01:06.924
Tires screeched, and everyone jumped out of the way.

18
00:01:08.005 --> 00:01:12.288
Vroom! The Ultra Car smashed through the glass doors and drove away.

19
00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:17.192
Roxy and her friends were at a city bus stop.

20
00:01:18.192 --> 00:01:19.353
They'd been at the library.

21
00:01:20.334 --> 00:01:21.315
Now they were going home.

22
00:01:23.196 --> 00:01:24.297
Jack looked at a poster.

23
00:01:24.317 --> 00:01:28.280
"I wish we could go to the Metro City Car Show."

24
00:01:29.584 --> 00:01:31.605
"We have to go home," said Roxy.

25
00:01:32.506 --> 00:01:33.386
Jack rolled his eyes.

26
00:01:33.406 --> 00:01:35.708
"I didn't mean right now.

27
00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:37.308
I meant soon.

28
00:01:38.169 --> 00:01:38.989
It would be cool."

29
00:01:39.009 --> 00:01:42.311
"We should go this weekend," said Terrell.

30
00:01:42.972 --> 00:01:44.512
"Maybe our parents will take us."

31
00:01:45.833 --> 00:01:47.474
"I'll ask my parents tonight!"

32
00:01:47.714 --> 00:01:48.275
said Mara.

33
00:01:48.295 --> 00:01:53.077
"I wonder if there are cars that fly at the show," said Jack.

34
00:01:53.097 --> 00:01:57.560
"Zoom!" He held out his arms and ran in circles.

35
00:01:59.072 --> 00:02:01.733
"A flying car would be awesome," said Terrell.

36
00:02:01.753 --> 00:02:05.214
"I wish I could fly," said Mara.

37
00:02:05.234 --> 00:02:07.734
"It would be so much fun!"

38
00:02:08.595 --> 00:02:09.295
Roxy nodded.

39
00:02:09.315 --> 00:02:11.015
"It does sound like fun."

40
00:02:11.035 --> 00:02:14.276
"We could fly to the library," said Terrell.

41
00:02:14.296 --> 00:02:16.097
"Or to the zoo."

42
00:02:16.117 --> 00:02:19.297
"Or to the car show!"

43
00:02:19.518 --> 00:02:20.058
said Jack.

44
00:02:21.078 --> 00:02:22.698
Mara watched a pigeon fly by.

45
00:02:22.718 --> 00:02:25.979
"We could fly anywhere we wanted," she said.

46
00:02:25.999 --> 00:02:28.120
"Just like birds."

47
00:02:30.112 --> 00:02:31.894
"I have an idea," said Terrell.

48
00:02:31.914 --> 00:02:35.236
"We can ask Rocket Girl to help us fly!"

49
00:02:36.257 --> 00:02:37.098
Roxy laughed.

50
00:02:37.118 --> 00:02:40.841
"I'm sure Rocket Girl is too busy for that."

51
00:02:41.802 --> 00:02:42.682
Terrell frowned.

52
00:02:42.702 --> 00:02:44.143
"I guess you're right."

53
00:02:45.645 --> 00:02:47.086
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

54
00:02:50.308 --> 00:02:52.950
She stepped away from her friends and pressed a button on the watch.

55
00:02:54.332 --> 00:02:55.593
Mayor Bloom's face appeared.

56
00:02:55.613 --> 00:02:58.195
"Mayor Bloom," Roxy whispered.

57
00:02:58.215 --> 00:02:59.616
"What's wrong?"

58
00:03:00.984 --> 00:03:02.445
"There's trouble at the car show!"

59
00:03:02.685 --> 00:03:03.226
said the mayor.

60
00:03:03.246 --> 00:03:06.548
"Someone has stolen the Ultra Car!

61
00:03:07.589 --> 00:03:09.770
It's the most amazing car ever invented.

62
00:03:10.571 --> 00:03:11.872
And now a thief has it!"

63
00:03:11.892 --> 00:03:14.874
"Don't worry, Mayor," said Roxy.

64
00:03:15.554 --> 00:03:17.376
"Rocket Girl is on her way!"
